      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That won’t work, because VRC has no real way to detect something like that.\n\nFor example, I’m a PCVR user - I could simply start the recording directly on my VR headset, and the PC wouldn’t even be aware of it.\n\nVRC could scan the PC for recording software all it wants; it still wouldn’t help.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
