  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-12-22T12:24:35.373Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would wish for a System where People that use services like NVIDIA ShadowPlay or Medal get marked with a symbol. I see a big problem in Privacy when people can turn that on and record people without their knowledge. Maybe not just a symbol but a setting where those systems will be disable automatically when a user specified that he doesn’t want that.",
